notes = "Local JAR MIDlet-1 loading; JAD files are not read. RMS and FileConnection saves are core-managed under <save directory>/nano_j2me/<normalized JAR stem>/. Manual save states are architecture/ABI/build dependent; decoded heap PCM and playback cursors are preserved, native playback handles/queues are cleared, and external files are not rewound. No rewind, runahead, netplay or determinism claim. MIT code, Apache-2.0 AMR data and OFL font notices accompany distribution."
description = "A native C99 J2ME runtime for MIDP MIDlets, with handset profiles, keypad/pointer input and software video. No external JVM or BIOS is required. Loads local JAR content; JAD and network services are not supported by this core."
